Liquid dynamic viscosity:    1.0e-3
Gas dynamic viscosity:       1.0e-3 ! 1.8e-5
Liquid density:              1000
Gas density:                 1000 ! 1
Surface tension coefficient: 0.072

# Options
# Options
Marangoni :  0 0 0
Pressure : 1
Smoothing Option : 1
